@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Conversation Details

actor "TeamMember" as TeamMember
participant "ConversationDetailView" as ConvDetailView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

TeamMember -> ConvDetailView : 1 Open conversation detail page
activate ConvDetailView
ConvDetailView -> ConvDetailView : 2 Display conversation details

ConvDetailView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request conversation data
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch conversation info
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve conversation record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return conversation data
ClerkAuth -> ConvDetailView : 7 Return conversation info
ConvDetailView -> TeamMember : 8 Display conversation details

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate ConvDetailView

@enduml
